✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (2.582584ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (1.680584ms)\nℹ tests 13\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 13\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 26671.527806\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":27,"nanos":433014522}},"started_at_ms":1795497182611,"completed_at_ms":1795497210045}}
