{"timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:40:47.557Z","ordinal":108004,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a20c42-e8d0-7ec1-8d46-757074eef47b","turn_id":"01a20c42-e8d0-7ec1-8d46-757074eef47b","last_agent_message":"I’m addressing a security gap in the context maturity work on `release/v1.3.0`: workspace freshness checks fingerprint the Git checkout, and repository Git settings could make that run configured programs.\n\nI’m adding a fail-closed check so unsafe or uninspectable Git settings leave freshness marked unknown, with a clear reason. I’ll add hostile-repository tests and update the evidence. I’m keeping clear of the audit files currently owned by PRs #771/#772; once those changes land, I’ll rebase and requalify this branch.","started_at":1795502041,"completed_at":1795502447,"duration_ms":406250,"time_to_first_token_ms":1687}}
