d packages/core/script/snapshot-parity.ts around lines 22-44 via the local lexical XERJ index. Rejected copying managed-repository behavior because Nexus inspects untrusted workspaces; will use a fail-closed preflight and explicit incomplete-context evidence.\"}'"}],"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":3998063}},"started_at_ms":1795502543350,"completed_at_ms":1795502543354}}
