{"timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:49:44.308Z","ordinal":108314,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f54f-2cb2-7201-ad27-acf2d9bbd90e","turn_id":"01a20c49-1bcf-7563-9889-443e19f9956a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-128d2ddc-6d12-49f1-adc3-5714b119dcc3","process_id":"61214","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","TEST_HOME=$(mktemp -d); HOME=\"$TEST_HOME\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$TEST_HOME/.config\" node --import tsx --test test/context_inventory.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-v130/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"TEST_HOME=$(mktemp -d); HOME=\"$TEST_HOME\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$TEST_HOME/.config\" node --import tsx --test test/context_inventory.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ inventory has stable source identity, scope isolation, and omits source text (9.406318ms)\n✔ freshness is asserted only with an invalidation rule and is demoted after persistence (1.598921ms)\n✔ workspace fingerprints detect changed repository state and retain only stale repository references (3.2331ms)\n✔ agent workspace fingerprint is bounded by candidate limits and returns unknown on failure (273.415864ms)\n✔ workspace candidate fingerprint changes when tracked repository content changes (631.331158ms)\n✔ context fingerprint refuses a configured clean filter without running it (195.740007ms)\n✔ context fingerprint refuses fsmonitor and included Git configuration before invoking commands (186.042969ms)\n✔ message provenance retains opaque tool-call references without exposing raw identifiers (2.086108ms)\n✔ inference request manifests capture the exact dispatch arrays without retaining content (6.383597ms)\n✔ manifest estimates include all request messages even when source references are capped (29.568286ms)\n✔ active system-prompt inventory slices current bytes and refuses stale offsets (1.915183ms)\n✔ failed and interrupted inference manifest states remain unknown rather than successful (2.516957ms)\n✔ source failures and deterministic inventory limits report incomplete context (0.859868ms)\n✔ context inspection enforces a total retrieval budget and records timed-out sources (261.221808ms)\n✔ merging a saved inventory with archive references stays bounded and reports omissions (16.921014ms)\n✔ assessment keeps dimensions separate and reports insufficient evidence (1.731126ms)\n✔ context command is discoverable and dispatched through the common REPL/TUI route (1.061305ms)\n✔ context inspection and maturity execute without provider calls and emit parseable evidence (1085.782198ms)\n✔ session save, resume, compaction, and export retain source references without promoting memory (136.824973ms)\nℹ tests 19\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 19\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 5237.577452\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":6,"nanos":18219552}},"started_at_ms":1795502978287,"completed_at_ms":1795502984306}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:49:44.451Z","ordinal":108315,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a20c51-4d02-74b0-b1a2-350348991a8f","call_id":"call_890743fb51424440b6c76281839904c1","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"0115bd\",\"wall_time_seconds\":2.454619053,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":517,\"output\":\"✔ inventory has stable source identity, scope isolation, and omits source text (9.406318ms)\\n✔ freshness is asserted only with an invalidation rule and is demoted after persistence (1.598921ms)\\n✔ workspace fingerprints detect changed repository state and retain only stale repository references (3.2331ms)\\n✔ agent workspace fingerprint is bounded by candidate limits and returns unknown on failure (273.415864ms)\\n✔ workspace candidate fingerprint changes when tracked repository content changes (631.331158ms)\\n✔ context fingerprint refuses a configured clean filter without running it (195.740007ms)\\n✔ context fingerprint refuses fsmonitor and included Git configuration before invoking commands (186.042969ms)\\n✔ message provenance retains opaque tool-call references without exposing raw identifiers (2.086108ms)\\n✔ inference request manifests capture the exact dispatch arrays without retaining content (6.383597ms)\\n✔ manifest estimates include all request messages even when source references are capped (29.568286ms)\\n✔ active system-prompt inventory slices current bytes and refuses stale offsets (1.915183ms)\\n✔ failed and interrupted inference manifest states remain unknown rather than successful (2.516957ms)\\n✔ source failures and deterministic inventory limits report incomplete context (0.859868ms)\\n✔ context inspection enforces a total retrieval budget and records timed-out sources (261.221808ms)\\n✔ merging a saved inventory with archive references stays bounded and reports omissions (16.921014ms)\\n✔