{"timestamp":"2026-11-24T07:42:46.343Z","ordinal":109468,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f54f-2cb2-7201-ad27-acf2d9bbd90e","turn_id":"01a20c6e-33b2-7660-a7f0-668b82778aee","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-12138fb6-1ce1-462d-99d5-895d9127ed83","process_id":"97979","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '2540,2565p' /tmp/context-maturity-make-test-19f34a02-built.log"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-v130","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '2540,2565p' /tmp/context-maturity-make-test-19f34a02-built.log","name":"context-maturity-make-test-19f34a02-built.log","path":"/tmp/context-maturity-make-test-19f34a02-built.log"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ no custom field at the root of a type of the specification: every outbound message keeps Nexus's data under _meta (1.941033ms)\n✔ inventory has stable source identity, scope isolation, and omits source text (8.653105ms)\n✔ freshness is asserted only with an invalidation rule and is demoted after persistence (1.239811ms)\n✔ workspace fingerprints detect changed repository state and retain only stale repository references (2.859662ms)\n✔ agent workspace fingerprint is bounded by candidate limits and returns unknown on failure (248.453016ms)\n✔ workspace candidate fingerprint changes when tracked repository content changes (552.701988ms)\n✔ context fingerprint refuses a configured clean filter without running it (176.409426ms)\n✔ context fingerprint refuses fsmonitor and included Git configuration before invoking commands (151.111684ms)\n✔ context fingerprint refuses a global clean filter used by workspace attributes (107.207257ms)\n✔ message provenance retains opaque tool-call references without exposing raw identifiers (1.748486ms)\n✔ inference request manifests capture the exact dispatch arrays without retaining content (5.04181ms)\n✔ manifest estimates include all request messages even when source references are capped (22.217968ms)\n✔ active system-prompt inventory slices current bytes and refuses stale offsets (1.897292ms)\n✔ failed and interrupted inference manifest states remain unknown rather than successful (1.981707ms)\n✔ source failures and deterministic inventory limits report incomplete context (0.853266ms)\n✖ ACC-CONT-03: pressure compaction of a work unit survives SIGKILL and restores archived markers (7267.159856ms)\n✔ context inspection enforces a total retrieval budget and records timed-out sources (251.595604ms)\n✔ merging a saved inventory with archive references stays bounded and reports omissions (16.12553ms)\n✔ assessment keeps dimensions separate and reports insufficient evidence (1.793921ms)\n✔ context command is discoverable and dispatched through the common REPL/TUI route (1.041506ms)\n✔ context inspection and maturity execute without provider calls and emit parseable evidence (1217.266333ms)\n✔ session save, resume, compaction, and export retain source references without promoting memory (196.208221ms)\n✔ runAsAclArgs scopes evaluator and operator permissions with directory defaults (29.399223ms)\n✔ asUserSpec preserves timeout metadata and isolated processes reject missing timeouts (18.514805ms)\n▶ V2: unverified changes survive retries, step limits, restarts and resumes\n  ✖ retry after UNVERIFIED: the resumed attempt changes nothing, the unit stays unverified and its dependent never runs (4934.864955ms)\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":985019175}},"started_at_ms":1795506165357,"completed_at_ms":1795506166342}}
