tures exercise multiple adapter request/reply contracts and a minimal local OpenAI-compatible workflow; they do not qualify live provider services or replace the full system workflow evaluation.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a20c6e-33b2-7660-a7f0-668b82778aee","create_time":1795506569.2952716}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":49323,"sampled_through_sequence":49321,"client_authored":false}}
